---
---
<section class="band" id="about" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="why">
      <div class="about-head">
        <div class="lead">
          <div class="label">— 關於奕德</div>
          <h2>不只是<em>仲介</em>，<br>是長期的<em>居住管家</em>。</h2>
        </div>
        <aside class="about-aside">
          <span class="quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">"</span>
          <p class="quote-text">好的居住，需要好的中介者。透明、穩定、責任歸屬，是奕德服務的核心。</p>
          <div class="meta">
            <div class="row"><span class="k">Service area</span><span class="v">大台南 · 東區 / 中西 / 北區 / 安平 / 永康 / 仁德</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span class="k">Plans</span><span class="v">包租 / 代管</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span class="k">Updates</span><span class="v">物件與 FAQ 均動態同步</span></div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>

      <div class="why-grid">
        <div class="why-item">
          <div class="num">01</div>
          <h4>在地深耕，大台南</h4>
          <p>東區、中西區、北區、安平、永康、仁德皆有代管物件，熟悉台南租屋市場與在地需求。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item">
          <div class="num">02</div>
          <h4>一份合約，雙向安心</h4>
          <p>房東收益穩定、房客一個窗口。租務、收租、退租點交全程由奕德負責，不必兩邊跑。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="why-item">
          <div class="num">03</div>
          <h4>透明、無仲介費</h4>
          <p>房客零仲介費，所有條款列在電子合約中。費用清楚，沒有第二份隱藏成本。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
/* ---------- about / why ---------- */
.why{
  background: var(--surface-soft);
  border-radius: var(--r-lg);
  padding: 64px 56px;
}
@media (max-width: 720px){ .why{ padding: 40px 28px; } }
.why-grid{
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 36px;
  margin-top: 24px;
}
@media (max-width: 720px){ .why-grid{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; } }
.why-item .num{
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 22px;
  color: var(--accent);
}
.why-item h4{
  font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;
  margin: 12px 0 8px;
  letter-spacing: -.1px;
}
.why-item p{
  margin: 0;
  color: var(--body);
  font-size: 14.5px;
  line-height: 1.65;
}
/* about right aside */
.about-head{
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
  gap: 56px;
  align-items: flex-start;
  margin-bottom: 48px;
}
@media (max-width: 820px){
  .about-head{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
}
.about-head .lead .label{
  font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 1.2px; text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--accent-deep);
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.about-head .lead h2{
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: clamp(36px, 4.5vw, 54px);
  line-height: 1.06;
  letter-spacing: -.7px;
  margin: 0;
  text-wrap: balance;
  max-width: 14ch;
}
.about-head .lead h2 em{ font-style: italic; color: var(--accent); }
.about-aside{
  position: relative;
  padding-left: 28px;
}
.about-aside .quote-mark{
  position: absolute;
  left: 0; top: -8px;
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 64px;
  line-height: 1;
  color: var(--accent);
  user-select: none;
}
.about-aside .quote-text{
  font-family: var(--serif);
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 20px;
  line-height: 1.45;
  color: var(--ink);
  margin: 0 0 24px;
  letter-spacing: -.2px;
}
.about-aside .meta{
  border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);
}
.about-aside .meta .row{
  display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px;
  padding: 12px 0;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline);
}
.about-aside .meta .k{
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 1.2px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--muted);
  flex-shrink: 0;
  width: 96px;
}
.about-aside .meta .v{
  color: var(--ink);
  font-size: 14.5px;
  line-height: 1.4;
}
</style>
